# The brief under construction (docs/design/2026-10-21-brief-rework.md): what the player and the commander read by
# default since 2026-10-23 (the arena without `--brief`, run/human_game.sh; the user: the default while it is built
# up, to see what the content so far does before more is added). One document path a line, in reading order; `#`
# lines and blank lines are ignored. Generated documents are written by their generators
# (the fact layer: run/fact_units.py); hand-written ones carry `<!--meta -->` blocks (run/brief_check.py checks
# their ids; run/brief_coverage.py tallies what of the old brief they cover). Shown by run/brief_view.py as its
# "Player, rework brief" tab; printed by `bot --print-prompt player`.
docs/briefs/facts/economy.md
docs/briefs/facts/fights.md
docs/briefs/facts/maps.md
# The unit tables are generated at assembly from the glossary for the factions in the game, each unit at the level
# the unit context's rules give it (docs/design/2026-11-04-unit-context.md, crates/bot/src/strategist/unit_context.rs);
# the documents after the arrow are the same tables whole, for the scripts and the meta ids.
generated:units <- docs/briefs/facts/units-economy.md docs/briefs/facts/units-land.md docs/briefs/facts/units-structures.md docs/briefs/facts/units-air.md docs/briefs/facts/units-sea.md
docs/briefs/meta/pool.md
docs/briefs/meta/people.md
docs/briefs/meta/barb.md
docs/briefs/meta/apex.md
docs/briefs/meta/formats.md
docs/briefs/derived/metal.md
